    "summary": "`goodui.main-menu` is the topbar's right-hand action group. Its default composition contains [Search](./search.md), [Notifications](./notifications.md), [Theme toggle](./theme-toggle.md), and [Avatar menu](./avatar-menu.md), in that order. [Settings](./settings.md) is an additional optional action. Each action is a separate Penpot library component with a 36 × 36 px hit area. MainMenu owns spacing and alignment; individual actions have no external margins.",
